  "bodyHtml": "<p><strong>500WS Eat Lunch with Laura Lots</strong></p><p>Laura Lots is a team member of the Gender Equality in Research Funding team of the Swiss National Science Foundation (SNSF) and the Project coordinator of AcademiaNet, which is an Expert Database of Outstanding Women Academics, similar to Request a Woman in STEM.</p><p>​</p><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-d53d9383113e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-e17b763c8092.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-24e426b27801.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-c1b91db2a2ef.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-4816b6af8a22.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-45532f2e1974.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-012c601bb795.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-bf7eab2f27da.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-206c44c4af1c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-b8d426974259.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-7628353a533e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/500ws/assets/archive-556c56e024f0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>¨500WS eat lunch&quot; is a series of networking events in which our members have the opportunity to meet women leaders in academia, industry, funding bodies and research institutions and discuss career strategies with them and get valuable advice and insights.</p>",
